#: src/introduction.md:1
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid "This manual describes the mathematics of ExchangeAlgebra and how to use its Haskell operations. Start with [From journal entries to exchange algebra](overview.md), which maps a journal table onto the algebra's notation. [Definitions and axioms](algebra/definitions.md) then defines how the library represents postings and separates debits from credits. For module documentation and the full API, see the [Haddock reference on Hackage](https://hackage.haskell.org/package/exchangealgebra)."
msgstr "このマニュアルでは, ExchangeAlgebra の数学的基盤と Haskell の演算の使い方を説明します. まず, 仕訳帳の表と代数の記法を対応づける[仕訳から交換代数へ](overview.md)を読んでください. [定義と公理](algebra/definitions.md)では, ライブラリが項 (posting) を表現し, 借方と貸方に分ける方法を定義します. モジュールの説明と API の全体については, [Hackage の Haddock リファレンス](https://hackage.haskell.org/package/exchangealgebra)を参照してください."

#: src/overview.md:1
msgid "From journal entries to exchange algebra"
msgstr "仕訳から交換代数へ"

#: src/overview.md:3
msgid "This page maps a journal written as a debit and credit table onto exchange algebra notation, using four transactions of a small shop. It assumes familiarity with double-entry bookkeeping and no knowledge of the algebra. [Definitions and axioms](algebra/definitions.md) gives the formal definitions."
msgstr "小さな店舗の 4 件の取引を使い, 借方と貸方の表で書いた仕訳帳を交換代数の記法に対応づけます. 複式簿記の知識を前提としますが, 交換代数の知識は必要ありません. 形式的な定義は[定義と公理](algebra/definitions.md)を参照してください."

