msgstr "`equal`, `(.==)`, `(./=)`"

#: src/algebra/elements.md:111
msgid "Symmetric wildcard-aware comparison and its negation. `(.==)` also handles partially wildcarded tuples."
msgstr "wildcard を考慮した対称な比較とその否定. `(.==)` は一部の座標が wildcard であるタプルも扱います."

#: src/algebra/elements.md:112
